successfully leveraging CVE-2021-20042&amp;nbsp;against impacted SMA 100 devices
can allow the remote unauthenticated attacker to use SMA 100 series devices as
an &quot;unintended proxy or intermediary&quot; (aka Confused Deputy - see CWE-441).
